      "review_description": "I done a Facebook enquiry for my mums solar issues. John from Adelaide Sparks &Solar called me first and I got him to come round and check out my mums system. He was on time, knew what he was doing. Gave us a quote and they got the job.The electrician Ash was fantastic knew his job to a tee and the 2 other installers were done a fantastic job of installing the 18 panels while Ash installed the new Inverter.They were all on time and were very professional. Cleaned up after the job was done and were very polite and friendly.I would highly recommend this company for all Solar and electrical needs anytime. Great pricing as well. Very good quality system.Thank you again John, Ash and the guys for making my mum very happy",
